      "warnings": [
        "Caller selects token pair/path, pool fee, recipient, deadline, input/output bounds and price limit where present; source admission does not validate those financial choices.",
        "Packed path bytes encode token addresses and uint24 fees, not arbitrary external executor calldata. Exact-output multihop paths are reversed relative to exact-input paths.",
        "All four functions are payable and can spend native ETH when paying WETH. Excess msg.value and unspent native input are NOT automatically refunded; refundETH is not admitted here. Prefer pre-approved WETH/ERC20 input with zero value to avoid leaving publicly recoverable router surplus.",
